# Symbolic Alpha layout and encoding over fixed typed arenas.
# Input: little-endian u32 label count, fixed 12-byte item records, then 0xff.
# Record bytes are kind, register fields a/b/c, and eight immediate bytes.
# Label and target items use the low four immediate bytes as a u32 identity.

